Symbiont – AI-Driven Industrial Symbiosis Platform

Symbiont is an AI-powered Industrial Symbiosis Platform developed during QW'26 Sustain-a-thon, where it secured 3rd place.
The platform promotes a circular economy by connecting industries that generate waste with businesses that can reuse those materials as valuable raw resources.

By leveraging AI-driven matching, Symbiont helps reduce industrial waste, lower disposal costs, and improve resource efficiency.
The platform also includes a B2B waste exchange marketplace, analytics for waste valuation and optimization, and automated ESG reporting to support sustainable industrial practices.

Key Features
- AI-powered waste-to-resource matching
- B2B marketplace for industrial waste exchange
- Waste analytics and optimization dashboard
- Automated ESG and sustainability reporting
- Circular economy-focused solution aligned with the UN SDGs


